title: "brick-brec: BREC, a Brick Reconstruction Ontology and pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Ontology (CIDOC CRM, CRMdig, CRMinf, PROV-O, DCAT, DQV) and reproducible pipeline for documenting the path from a
  structure-from-motion scan of an interlocking-brick model to an idealised brick reconstruction, its interpretation and its FDOx packaging.
